# Copy to private/sensitive-patterns.txt (git-ignored) and list YOUR values, one per line.
# Matched as fixed strings, case-insensitively, against every added line and every commit message.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored. An empty list makes the guard refuse every commit.
#
# Typical entries:
#   your Apple Developer Team ID
#   your iPhone's and Watch's hardware UDIDs and CoreDevice ids (xcrun devicectl list devices)
#   your devices' names and serial numbers
#   your home IP address or network name
#   specific identifiers from your own health data (workout UUIDs)
